        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Stoke Newington Central, Stoke Newington, London, London Borough of Hackney\n- Organizations: Hackney North and Stoke Newington constituency, Labour Party\n- People: Diane Abbott\n- Roles: Member of Parliament, Shadow Home Secretary\n\nFacts:\n- Diane Abbott was born on 27 September 1953.\n- Diane Abbott is a British Labour Party politician.\n- In October 2016, Diane Abbott was appointed Shadow Home Secretary.\n- Stoke Newington Central is a ward in the London Borough of Hackney.\n- Stoke Newington Central corresponds roughly to Stoke Newington in London, UK.\n- Stoke Newington Central forms part of the Hackney North and Stoke Newington constituency of Diane Abbott, who is its MP.",
